  "name": "Lead brake-check then release",
  "description": "A same-lane lead vehicle visibly and deliberately brakes sharply to a crawl, creating a late car-following conflict, then resumes flowing speed before the ego reaches it. The initial spacing and delayed ego response make the closest approach occur during the recorded clip rather than at spawn.",
  "createdAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
